  "title": "Announcing the launch of throxy 2.0 - Throxy",
  "summary": "We've added human cold calling to Throxy. Here's why and what we're seeing. In October, our internal growth team increased their volume of cold calls to Throxy prospects: software companies selling into manufacturing, logistics, and healthcare. It booked meetings, but more importantly, it gave us raw market feedback on what resonated, what didn't, and which parts of our offering prospects already had covered.",
